<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MedPartners rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MedPartners rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Montgomery Securities analyst Amy de Rham said she initiated coverage of MedPartners Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- She said she expects the company to earn $0.90 per share in fiscal 1996 and $1.15 in fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>-- Her target price for the stock is $35, about 55 percent above current levels.</p>
<p>-- MedPartners is a physician practice management company.</p>
</text>
